<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">Our upcoming blood drive is <span style="background:
yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;date/time&gt;</span> at <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;location&gt;</span> and we
need you to be a part of this lifesaving event! <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Join us as we embark on a mission that can make an
immense difference in the lives of countless individuals.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">I am also pleased to share that the Red Cross expanded its
testing to include sickle cell trait screening on all donations from
self-identified African American, Black, and multiracial donors. This screening
will help the Red Cross identify compatible blood types more quickly to help
sickle cell patients and provide an additional health insight for donors.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p>

<ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     line-height:105%;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1">In the U.S., it is estimated
     that over 100,000 people have sickle cell disease — most who are of
     African descent and will require regular blood transfusions to help manage
     their disease. <o:p></o:p></li>
</ul>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b>Here’s how you can help: <o:p></o:p></b></p>

<ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     line-height:105%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2">Sign up to donate at <a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org">RedCrossClood.org</a> using sponsor
     code <b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;background:yellow;mso-highlight:
     yellow">&lt;code&gt;</span></b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
     mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold">, or via the Red
     Cross </span><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/blood-donor-app.html"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:
     Arial;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold">Blood Donor App</span></a><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:
     Arial;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold">, or by replying to me. </span><o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:
     auto;line-height:105%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold">Complete
     your </span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
     mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">health questionnaire via<span style="mso-bidi-font-weight:bold"> </span></span><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/donate-blood/manage-my-donations/rapidpass.html">RapidPass</a>®
     <span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:
     Arial">and save time on the day of the blood drive.</span><o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:
     auto;line-height:105%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2">Review the Sickle Cell
     Trait Screening <a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/faq.html#donating-blood-sickle-cell-trait-screen">FAQs</a>
     and visit <a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/donate-blood/blood-types/diversity/african-american-blood-donors/sickle-cell-trait-screening.html">RedCrossBlood.org/SCTrait</a>
     to learn more.<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     line-height:105%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2">Spread the word and bring
     friends, family and colleagues to donate.<o:p></o:p></li>
</ul>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b>Here's what you need to know about the sickle cell trait
screening: <o:p></o:p></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">Blood transfusion is an essential treatment for those with
sickle cell disease, and blood donations from individuals of the same ethnicity
and blood type have a unique ability to help patients fighting sickle cell
disease. <o:p></o:p></p>

<ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     line-height:105%;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3">The blood donation process will
     not change — donations will be screened using samples obtained at the time
     of donation. <o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:
     auto;line-height:105%;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3">There will be no charge to
     donors. <o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:
     auto;line-height:105%;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3">Due to the anticipated high
     demand, appointments are highly encouraged. <o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:
     auto;line-height:105%;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3">Donors can expect to
     receive results to their screenings within one to two weeks through our
     Red Cross Blood Donor App and the online donor portal at
     RedCrossBlood.org. <o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     line-height:105%;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3">Donors need to have a successful
     donation to receive the screening results. <o:p></o:p></li>
</ul>

<p class="MsoNormal">Let’s come together and show the true power of giving! If
you have any questions, please contact me, a Red Cross representative at
1-800-RED CROSS, or visit <a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org">RedCrossBlood.org</a>.<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">Sincerely,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;Name&gt;</span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>]]></td>
</tr>
